            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>Major air leakage area was in the crawlspace. The vapor barrier is not sealed properly and should be taped at all of the seams. The floor joist is also not sealed properly. 



Some air leakage around door and window frames as well.</airSeal>
                <foundation />
                <VentilationSystem>This house does not have a proper ventilation system. A HRV could be installed quite easily as all rooms are accessible from the crawlspace. This will provide proper ventilation in the home and will improve the air quality.</VentilationSystem>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
